@startuml UC04 - AI Lead Scoring - Sequence Diagram
title UC04 - AI Lead Scoring - Sequence Diagram

participant "Scheduler / System" as SYS
participant "NestJS API" as API
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "n8n" as N8N
participant "AI / LLM" as AI

SYS -> API : 1. Request Lead Scoring
API -> DB : 2. Get Lead
DB --> API : 3. Lead data
API -> DB : 4. Get Qualification
DB --> API : 5. Qualification data
API -> DB : 6. Get Enrichment
DB --> API : 7. Enrichment data
API -> DB : 8. Get Interactions
DB --> API : 9. Interaction history
API -> MQ : 10. Publish scoring event
MQ -> N8N : 11. Deliver scoring event
N8N -> AI : 12. Calculate Lead Score

@enduml
